@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam shadowing false
title POST /api/workspace/v1/users/{user_uuid}/actions/avatar_upload/invoke
actor "客户端" as Client
participant "控制器 RestAlchemy" as API
database "配置文件存储器" as STORE
database "用户 Workspace 在 PostgreSQL" as DB
queue "交易 outbox" as OUT
queue "delivery_snapshot_event\nexact user scope" as TASK
participant "沃克人游泳池" as WORKER
database "公众活动存储器" as EVENT
participant "控制器 WebSocket" as DISP
participant "客户 Workspace" as WS
Client -> API: POST multipart 有一个像
API -> API: 检查 MIME/签名/尺寸
API -> STORE: 保存字节 + 公共相关元数据
API -> DB: BEGIN; 插入文件元数据 + 更新模特
API -> OUT: 添加域名变更
API -> DB: COMMIT
API --> Client: 201 JSON 用户
API -> STORE: 如果没有链接,删除替换的像
OUT -> TASK: 其他 immutable delivery_snapshot_event\n每个人都有自己的 outbox_event_uuid + exact scope
TASK -> WORKER: 阅读最后一个用户
WORKER -> EVENT: 插入已完成的 user.updated
DISP -> EVENT: 发送/重复/播放
DISP -> WS: user.updated
@enduml
